    <mxCell id="notes" value="Flow — a request enters at Clients, is shaped by Edge, then renders a Page or hits an API route. Both call into Core Engine, which owns every read and write to the Data layer.&#10;Direct render path — /u/:handle and /u/:handle/badge.svg call lib/profile directly rather than through an API route (the amber edge on the left).&#10;Token scoping — the server GITHUB_TOKEN is repo-scoped and private-inclusive; a user's own OAuth token is not, so only the server token can heal a private-repo-blinded score.&#10;Gating — WebMCP, Creator Studio, experiments and the platform links are DB-backed feature flags. The env var is the fallback when a row is absent, not a kill switch." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDF2;strokeColor=#9A8F70;fontColor=#111827;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="100" y="1610" width="1180" height="92" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="s1" value="requests" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5A6572;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#111827;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.12;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.12;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="clients" target="edge">
